WEBVTT

00:05:00.036 --> 00:05:01.356
There is clear evidence

00:05:01.356 --> 00:05:04.396
that a single gene mutation
can lead to obesity,

00:05:04.396 --> 00:05:07.876
such as, for instance,
leptin deficiency and POMC deficiency.

00:05:08.836 --> 00:05:12.716
We also have two-three genes
leading to obesity.

00:05:12.756 --> 00:05:16.276
And it's my prediction that we,
by the year 2030,

00:05:16.276 --> 00:05:21.756
will be able to explain most obesity
by the genetic makeup of the individual.

00:05:22.836 --> 00:05:26.396
So obesity as a disease
by this measure, check.

00:05:28.036 --> 00:05:29.276
Let me be clear.